+- **`desktop/windows/browser/keyboard-layout-and-search-query-normalizer.cjs`**:
+  - `normalizeKeyboardLayoutAndSearchQuery(rawQuery)` and `executeLayoutResilientSearch`: detects and converts tokens accidentally typed in the wrong keyboard layout (`"ghjljk;ftv"` -> `"продолжаем"`, `"wtyf"` -> `"цена"`, `"chfdytybt"` -> `"сравнение"`) while preserving legitimate Latin technical terms (`Option`, `Alpha`, `SLA`, `API`, `p95`, `RPS`), and executes the normalized search query through `engine.searchService` with explicit `providerId` provenance.
