+  - `evaluateIframeSandboxAndCspDirectives`: parses `Content-Security-Policy` headers (`script-src`, `default-src`) and `<iframe sandbox="...">` attribute tokens, flagging dangerous sandbox escape combinations (`IFRAME_SANDBOX_ESCAPE_RISK` when `allow-scripts` and `allow-same-origin` are combined) and top-navigation hijacking (`IFRAME_TOP_NAVIGATION_HIJACK_RISK`).
+- **`desktop/windows/browser/asciidoc-and-rst-technical-report-exporter.cjs`**:
